                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg128">p. 128</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d61-f3" n="3" xml:id="d61-f3-content">
                <p>Regarding Secretary Acheson’s conversations with Schuman on May 8 and with Bevin
                    on May 10 regarding East-West trade, see Martin’s undated memorandum, <ref
                        target="#pg123">p. 123</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d61-f4" n="4" xml:id="d61-f4-content">
